Source code for running analysis

# 4 Metabolite-Gene Analyses. (src/gene-metabolite/)
Limma-voom association of untargeted metabolites with pseudobulk gene expression across cell types, followed by robustness analysis, pathway enrichment, and constraint/SFARI enrichment. 

| Order | Script | Description |
|-------|--------|-------------|
| 4.1 | `metabolite_gene_limma.R` | Limma-voom loop (submit via run_metabolite_gene_limma.sh in bin/docker) |
| 4.2 | `metabolite_gene_associations.Rmd` | Global FDR correction, hit annotation, scatter plots |
| 4.3 | `metabolite_gene_imputation_sensitivity.Rmd` | Check if imputation is driving associations |
| 4.4 | `gene_metabolite_gene_pathway_analysis.Rmd` | Gene-side pathway enrichment (fgsea) |
| 4.5 | `gene_metabolite_pathway_analysis.Rmd` | Metabolite-side pathway enrichment (MSEA/ORA) |
| 4.6 | `build_gene_sets.R` | Cache curated gene sets (MSigDB, KEGG, Reactome) |
| 4.7 | `geneset_enrichment.R` | Gene-set enrichment on association rankings |
| 4.8 | `constraint_enrichment.R` | gnomAD LOEUF constraint enrichment |
| 4.9 | `sfari_enrichment.R` | SFARI autism associated gene enrichment |

## Standalone Scripts

| Script | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `plot_pair_spotlight.R` | Metabolite–gene scatter plots for spotlight pairs |
| `qq_stable_associations.R` | QQ plots of DFBETAS-stable p-values |

## Shared Function Files

| File | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `pseudobulk_functions.R` | (sourced from src/gene-hormone/)
| `metabolite_functions.R` | (sourced from src/gene-metabolite/)


## Key Outputs
All outputs are written to `results/gene-metabolite/`.

| Directory | Contents |
|-----------|----------|
| `parquet-log2_na/` | Raw per-metabolite limma results (one parquet each) |
| `csv-log2_na/` | Thresholded hits, summary tables |
| `figures-log2_na/` | Volcano plots, scatter plots, summary figures |
| `stability-dfbetas-log2_na/` | DFBETAS-robust hit subset |
| `gene-pathway/` | Gene-side fgsea enrichment results |
| `metabolite-pathway/` | Metabolite-side MSEA/ORA results |
| `geneset/` | Gene-set enrichment results |
| `constraint/` | LOEUF constraint enrichment |
| `sfari/` | SFARI enrichment results |
| `inventory/` | Sample/cell-type grid inventory |

